BT /F1 9 Tf 44.0 533.0 Td (Summary) Tj ET
q 0.7 w 44.0 519.0 m 798.0 519.0 l S Q
BT /F1 9 Tf 44.0 500.0 Td (React fits because the application has many interactive screens, protected routes, upload flows, forms, modals,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 44.0 487.0 Td (dashboards, and recruiter workflows.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 44.0 466.0 Td (Flask fits because the backend needs lightweight API routing, file upload handling, session handling, and direct) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 44.0 453.0 Td (integration with Python AI and document-processing libraries.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 44.0 432.0 Td (MongoDB fits because recruitment data is flexible: resumes, parsed profiles, job descriptions, comparisons,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 44.0 419.0 Td (interviews, audit logs, and agent outputs can vary in shape.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 44.0 398.0 Td (OpenAI fits because the core product depends on natural language understanding: extracting resume/JD details,) Tj ET
